<title>HUNGARY: Hungary six-month T-bill yield falls to 21.78 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary six-month T-bill yield falls to 21.78 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on Hungary's six-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 21.78 percent, down from 22.40 percent at an auction two weeks ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	    12,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     33,966.96 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	   12,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		13,500 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    21.78 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     90.2523 pct</p>
</text>
